  "title": "Installation on TP-Link 7350 without SD-Card",
  "body": "I finished the installation without SD-card, it looks recording and analyzation works fine. What is the need of the sd-card?",
  "author": {
    "login": "Chabippe",
    "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/212981450?u=67931aa7f4efb272ecb33891fe059cc22c0e5362&v=4",
    "url": "https://github.com/Chabippe"
  },
